                    cm_cost:                `Cost/learner`,
                    cm_insights:            `What the board saw`,
                    subtitle:               `The board has mandated converting 2,400 frontline staff from cash-counters into advisory relationship managers within twelve months. Last year's training cost €3.1M and changed nothing: high enjoyment, near-zero transfer. You have €1.9M — €792 per learner — to design a rollout that actually changes behaviour, and prove it did.`,
                    header_tag:             `12 March 2026 · Banque Aurore SA, Strasbourg · Advisory Pivot — make the training stick this time`,
                    round_label:            `Round`,
