                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (Executive Sponsor & a skeptical CFO)`,
                    coach_intro:            `The pilot ticked every box — 82% completion, 3.9/5 enjoyment — and 89% of staff changed nothing. Don't repeat it. Giangreco's research is blunt: enjoyment is not what drives use; perceived usefulness, trainer quality and efficiency are. Design for relevance, fund the managers who reinforce it, and prove the behaviour changed — not that people liked it. And do it for €792 a head.`,

                    useful_label:           `Perceived Usefulness`,
