                    coach_r1_lowhonesty:    `<strong>This is how you repeat the pilot.</strong> Low willingness to name the transfer problem means you'll run a course, hit completion, and call it done. Name it honestly as a transfer problem.`,
                    coach_r2_tailored:      `<strong>Tailoring to real Aurore scenarios is the usefulness lever.</strong> When staff see content built around their own customers and products, perceived usefulness rises — and transfer follows. This is where the budget earns its return.`,
