                    coach_r3_elearning:     `<strong>E-learning alone is the pilot's cheap path.</strong> High completion, low transfer. Without a credible human and reinforcement it produces exactly the 11% you started with. Cheapest is not the same as cheapest-per-converted-advisor.`,
