                    coach_r4_happysheet:    `<strong>A happy-sheet measures reaction — Level 1 — and nothing else.</strong> It tells the CFO nothing about whether 2,400 people changed their behaviour or sold any advisory product. That's exactly the measurement that masked the pilot's failure.`,
